<code>assert \forall int i; \result < i && i <= fromIndex; this.get(i);</code>
--------------------
Looking at the comment: every bit strictly after the returned index (exclusive) up to and including the starting index `fromIndex` is set to true.

- Returned index = `\result` (exclusive lower bound → `i > \result`)
- Starting index = `fromIndex` (inclusive upper bound → `i <= fromIndex`)
- "set to true" → `this.get(i)`

